&lt;p&gt;As a member of the Applied AI, Democratic Partnerships team at Anthropic you will provide technical support to the governments of key international allies and civil-sector partners to support democratic resilience. Near-term work focuses on a few priority countries and partners, and will continue to expand with capacity. This role serves Anthropic&#39;s mission and public benefit goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In collaboration with the Policy, National Security, Product, Research, and Engineering teams, you&#39;ll help partners build, integrate, and ship Claude deployments. You will use your excellent communication skills to explain complex topics, including the potential benefits and harms of frontier AI, to technical and non-technical audiences alike. You will also play a critical role in identifying how our AI systems can best serve public interests in frontline democracies, while maintaining our best-in-class safety standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work directly with partner technical teams to build and ship Claude deployments. Guide their setup, architecture, and integration as they build with Claude Code and the Claude API.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build pilots and repeatable workflows that can scale across partner agencies, and support developer and university enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Document how to deploy Claude in low-connectivity, multilingual, and security-conscious environments, for reuse across partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the voice of our partners in frontline democracies and a key collaborator with our Product and Research teams to ensure we deliver the capabilities they need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel internationally to partner institutions for technical enablement and building relationships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish a shared vision for creating solutions that enable beneficial and safe AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the vision, strategy, and execution of innovative solutions that leverage our latest models’ capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support partner deployments in areas such as education, cyber resiliency and global health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
