&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4+ years of experience as a Customer Engineer, Forward Deployed Engineer, Sales Engineer, Solutions Architect, or Cybersecurity Engineer, working with governments, civil-sector organizations, or the public sector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience shipping software in imperfect conditions, and a practical approach to infrastructure constraints&lt;/p&gt;
