&lt;p&gt;Identify what&#39;s actually hard about deploying AI in life sciences (heterogeneous data, auditability requirements, the prototype-to-trust gap) and feed those findings back to product, engineering, and research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create technical content and documentation that lets partners self-serve, so what works for one institution can scale globally without the same level of hand-holding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
