&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Worked across both consumer and enterprise brands&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed qualitative or quantitative brand architecture or naming research, or managed naming, verbal identity, or research partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A background in linguistics, copywriting, or verbal identity, and experience using AI tools in creative work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to learn new, often technical, domains well enough to position, name, and brand them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
