&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort operating with ambiguity in a fast-moving environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Genuine interest in Anthropic’s mission and the role recruiting plays in achieving it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
