&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial agreements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to provide clear, practical legal guidance to non-lawyers on complex commercial law matter&lt;/p&gt;
