&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Anthropic as a Customer Success Manager for Life Sciences. You’ll be a strategic partner and trusted advisor to leading organizations working to accelerate scientific discovery, such as research institutes, academic medical centers, and scientific foundations. You’ll help these organizations harness the full potential of Claude through deep product expertise, use case discovery, and hands-on guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a Research and Life Sciences account team pod, working as one team with your Account Executive and Applied AI partners. Together you’ll shape account strategy with&amp;nbsp; you taking the lead on adoption, change management, and value realization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role doesn’t follow a single playbook. You’ll run a range of Customer Success motions, from deep 1:1 strategic partnership to one-to-many programs like webinars, hackathons, and cohort-based enablement. You’ll choose the motion based on top account and customer priorities and the best way to solve for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The insights you gather will directly inform our research priorities, product development (including how Claude for Life Sciences evolves), and strategies for beneficial AI deployment. That makes you a key voice in how we build and deliver AI systems that accelerate science for the benefit of society.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusting, strategic relationships with research leaders, scientists, principal investigators, and program directors to understand their scientific priorities, organizational goals, and impact objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with your Account Executive and Applied AI counterparts in the Research and Life Sciences pod on shared account plans, bringing in Product, Support, and other teams as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the right Customer Success motion for each account and customer priority, whether that’s dedicated 1:1 engagement, cohort-based onboarding, hackathons and build days, office hours, or researcher communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in Anthropic’s products, especially Claude for Science, guiding organizations and their researchers and scientists to the right solutions and most impactful use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor usage patterns and proactively drive adoption, identifying optimization opportunities and new applications for Claude across your book of business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute change management strategies suited to scientific and academic cultures, including Train the Trainer programs, Center of Excellence development, and enablement that respects partner capacity, governance requirements, and decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide partners through the technical and governance foundation for launch, including SSO and provisioning, workspace configuration, and data handling considerations for research and health data (such as HIPAA, IRB, and institutional data policies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own account and success plans and run Quarterly Impact Reviews that document and quantify value realized, such as research productivity, time-to-insight, and cost savings, and partner with Marketing on success stories and reference accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the repeatable playbooks, templates, and health metrics that define what “great” looks like for customer success in life sciences at Anthropic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in Customer Success, Technical Account Management, Solutions Engineering, or consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in life sciences research, with exposure to new technologies as a catalyst for accelerating progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with life sciences organizations, such as academic research institutions, research institutes, foundations, biotech, or pharma, and familiarity with how scientific research is conducted, funded, and governed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the regulatory, risk, and compliance needs of the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving success across both consumption-based and seat-based business models, with an understanding of the expansion levers and success metrics for each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing dedicated strategic accounts and delivering one-to-many programs, with the judgment to choose the right motion for the customer priority at hand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills, including working as part of an account team with Sales and technical partners and advocating effectively for customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency in AI/ML concepts, API integrations, and software implementation patterns, and the ability to explain them to audiences ranging from bench scientists and computational researchers to institutional leadership. Familiarity with scientific data types, research workflows, or bioinformatics tooling is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven, AI-first way of working, using adoption signals to guide decisions and building Claude-powered workflows into how you engage partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for both AI and accelerating scientific progress, with a strong interest in ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely, ethically, and deployed to benefit society&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for bringing order to chaos and an enthusiastic “roll up your sleeves” mentality. You are a true team player&lt;/li&gt;
