Sit with developer and landlord management (not only the operations team) to see what is going wrong and what is going right, and turn what our construction leads are seeing into contract positions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own version control, the notice calendar and the claims register.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Help onboard two senior contract specialists on the team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have carried complex commercial agreements from term sheet to signature as the person holding the issues list, in real estate, energy, infrastructure, construction or project finance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can read a lease, work letter or construction contract and say in plain English who carries which risk and what happens when a date is missed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have held your ground with counterparties in challenging situations day after day without losing the facts or the relationship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Write short memos a busy executive can approve from.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable walking a construction site and asking management direct questions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stay exact on versions and details when the timeline is days, not weeks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have legal or commercial training. This is not a lawyer role and a law license is not required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have worked on data center, power or heavy industrial development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have amended, restructured or worked out a project that was already in trouble.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Know their way around the lender consents and financing documents that sit behind a lease.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Already use AI tools to compare documents, draft and track.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We can teach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data center vocabulary (commissioning levels, power feeds, ready for service conditions).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our form documents and internal approval systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Full time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation: [to be set]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regular travel to project sites in the US. Not site based. Travel 30% of the time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
