&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee third-party deployment, commissioning, and ongoing maintenance of facility infrastructure such as switch gear, technology cooling systems, and computer room air handlers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define expectations and standards to enable third-party success in each of the critical operations domains.&lt;/p&gt;
