&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of experience in data engineering, analytics engineering, or GTM data roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building a shared data product or platform that several teams depend on and contribute to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with company data such as firmographics, corporate hierarchies, or master data management&lt;/p&gt;
