&lt;li&gt;Understand and whenever possible proactively identify the data needs of stakeholder teams in terms of key data models and reporting, and translate that into technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, build and manage key data pipelines in dbt that transform raw logs into canonical datasets&lt;/li&gt;
