&lt;p&gt;The Growth team&#39;s job is to keep Anthropic on the exponential by getting more people and companies using and paying for Claude. Growth Data Scientists partner closely with growth product managers, engineers and marketers on experimentation, opportunity sizing, marketing measurement, strategic analysis and metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
