&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or related technical field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with modern data stack tools: Airflow, Terraform, BigQuery/Snowflake/Databricks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain Airflow DAGs orchestrating complex financial workflows, including Python scripts for DBT execution, authenticated API calls, and data quality validation&lt;/p&gt;
