&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Manage relationships with third-party payroll providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Respond to employee inquiries regarding international payroll matters in a timely and professional manner&lt;/li&gt;
