&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Support payroll systems integration projects and process automation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Process end-to-end payroll using Workday and Global Payroll Platform (PwC)&lt;/li&gt;
