&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developers and enterprises build on Claude through the Claude Platform. Our models are getting exponentially more intelligent, and our APIs and developer tools need to evolve just as quickly so developers can take advantage of that intelligence safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring Engineering Managers to lead teams that build these APIs and developer tools. We are shipping APIs and infrastructure for building and running agents in production. These APIs ship alongside SDKs, docs, and tooling that developers (and agents!) utilize in order to build high quality integrations. These abstractions are backed by our identity, verification, and trust platform, which lets us scale access to Claude responsibly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ordered_list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;order&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;listStyle&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{}]&quot;&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of engineers to ship high quality work quickly, owning planning, prioritization, delivery, and operational health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product to set your team&#39;s roadmap, and bring a strong point of view on what developers need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talk to customers directly and turn what you learn into engineering priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide API design and architecture decisions for distributed systems that have to stay reliable as usage grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Research, Safeguards, Security, and go-to-market teams to bring new model capabilities to developers safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, coach, and grow strong engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
