&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing high-performing software engineering teams shipping developer products, including hiring, coaching, and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re product-minded and customer-oriented. You care about who uses what your team builds, and you&#39;ve shaped roadmaps alongside product partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built and scaled distributed systems in production, and you have the technical depth required to guide architecture and API design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve led teams that ship quickly and hold a high quality bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate well across functions and can align teams you don&#39;t manage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about Anthropic&#39;s mission and about developing AI safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ordered_list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;order&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;listStyle&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,{},&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,{}]&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building agent infrastructure or products on top of LLMs&lt;/li&gt;
