&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;À propos du poste&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que responsable de compte Entreprise chez Anthropic, vous intégrerez l’équipe fondatrice en charge du déploiement de nos solutions API et SaaS de productivité, à la pointe de l’IA, à destination des organisations du secteur automobile en France. Vous favoriserez l’adoption d’une IA sûre et de pointe en concluant des accords stratégiques avec des constructeurs automobiles, des équipementiers de rang 1 et de rang 2, ainsi que des fournisseurs de solutions de mobilité. Vous mettrez à profit votre expertise en vente consultative dans le secteur automobile pour stimuler la croissance du chiffre d’affaires, tout en devenant un partenaire de confiance pour les parties prenantes du secteur automobile. Vous les accompagnerez dans l’intégration et le déploiement de l’IA, en explorant tout son potentiel dans les domaines de l’ingénierie et de la conception, des opérations de fabrication, des services de véhicules connectés et de l’après-vente. En collaboration avec les équipes GTM, Produit et Marketing, vous affinerez continuellement notre proposition de valeur, notre méthodologie de vente et notre positionnement sur le marché afin de répondre aux besoins des décideurs du secteur automobile.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le candidat idéal est passionné par le développement de nouveaux segments de marché, par l&#39;identification des opportunités à fort potentiel et mettre en œuvre des stratégies pour les saisir. En favorisant le déploiement des produits émergents d&#39;Anthropic, vous aiderez les entreprises à acquérir de nouvelles capacités tout en favorisant le développement éthique de l&#39;IA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsabilités:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développez le portefeuille clients et stimulez les revenus d’Anthropic dans le secteur automobile. Naviguez au sein d’organisations complexes du secteur automobile pour identifier les décideurs clés, les informer sur nos services et les accompagner vers le succès avec Anthropic. Vous serez responsable de l’ensemble du cycle de vente, depuis le premier contact jusqu’à la conclusion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et exécuter des stratégies de vente innovantes adaptées aux cycles d&#39;approvisionnement automobiles, à la qualification des fournisseurs et aux processus budgétaires afin d&#39;atteindre et de dépasser les objectifs de chiffre d&#39;affaires. Analyser les paysages, les tendances et la dynamique du marché automobile pour transformer les plans stratégiques en activités et campagnes de vente ciblées&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener l’expansion du marché en identifiant de nouveaux cas d’utilisation au sein des équipes d’ingénierie et de R&amp;amp;D, des fonctions de fabrication et de chaîne d’approvisionnement, des divisions véhicule connecté et logiciel, et des opérations d’après-vente. Collaborer de manière inter-fonctionnelle pour différencier nos offres destinées aux applications automobiles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naviguer dans des écosystèmes complexes de parties prenantes du secteur automobile, notamment les dirigeants, les responsables de l&#39;ingénierie et de la fabrication, les services informatiques et les bureaux d&#39;approvisionnement, afin de parvenir à un consensus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Informer les feuilles de route et les fonctionnalités des produits en recueillant les commentaires des utilisateurs et en transmettant les besoins du marché automobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fournir des informations qui renforcent notre proposition de valeur pour le secteur automobile&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affiner continuellement la méthodologie de vente automobile en intégrant les enseignements dans les guides, les modèles et les meilleures pratiques. Identifier les améliorations des processus qui optimisent la productivité et la cohérence des ventes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Profil recherché:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus de 12 ans d&#39;expérience en vente B2B dans le SaaS, les solutions API ou les technologies émergentes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un historique réussi de gestion de cycles de vente complexes au sein d’organisations du secteur automobile, avec la conclusion de contrats stratégiques grâce à une compréhension à la fois des exigences techniques et des cas d’utilisation dans le secteur automobile.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité démontrée à naviguer dans les structures organisationnelles et les processus d’approvisionnement du secteur automobile, en mobilisant l’adhésion des différents intervenants, notamment les dirigeants, les responsables de l’ingénierie et de la fabrication, et les services informatiques.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience approfondie dans la négociation d&#39;accords complexes au sein des cadres d&#39;approvisionnement automobile et des politiques de qualification des fournisseurs Expérience avérée de dépassement des objectifs de revenus grâce à une gestion efficace d&#39;un pipeline et d&#39;un processus de vente en constante évolution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellentes compétences en communication et capacité à faire des présentations avec assurance devant divers publics du secteur automobile, des ingénieurs et directeurs d’usine aux cadres supérieurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance approfondie des cycles d’achat du secteur automobile, des processus de décision et des principaux points de friction, y compris les longs délais liés aux programmes et les exigences de qualification des fournisseurs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une approche stratégique et analytique pour évaluer le marché automobile, combinée à une exécution créative et tactique pour saisir les opportunités&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intérêt marqué et/ou expérience dans les systèmes d’IA avancés et leurs applications. Vous êtes particulièrement attaché·e à ce que les systèmes d’IA de pointe soient développés de manière sûre et éthique pour un usage automobile.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive at Anthropic, you&#39;ll join the foundational team at the forefront of introducing our cutting-edge AI productivity API and SaaS solutions to automotive organisations across France. You&#39;ll drive the adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with vehicle manufacturers, tier one and tier two suppliers, and mobility providers. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise in the automotive sector to propel revenue growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;while becoming a trusted partner to automotive stakeholders, helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities in engineering and design, manufacturing operations, connected vehicle services, and aftersales. In collaboration with GTM, Product, and Marketing teams, you&#39;ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to resonate with automotive decision-makers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passion for developing new market segments, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By driving deployment of Anthropic&#39;s emerging products, you will help enterprises obtain new capabilities while also advancing the ethical development of AI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic within the automotive sector. Navigate complex automotive organisations to reach key decision-makers, educate them about our services, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to close&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies tailored to automotive procurement cycles, supplier qualification, and budgeting processes to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyse automotive market landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities and campaigns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead market expansion by identifying new use cases within engineering and R&amp;amp;D teams, manufacturing and supply chain functions, connected vehicle and software divisions, and aftersales operations. Collaborate cross-functionally to differentiate our offerings for automotive applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex automotive stakeholder ecosystems including executives, engineering and manufacturing leadership, IT departments, and procurement offices to build consensus * Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering feedback from users and conveying automotive market needs. Provide insights that strengthen our value proposition for automotive * Continuously refine the automotive sales methodology by incorporating learnings into playbooks, templates, and best practices. Identify process improvements that optimise sales productivity and consistency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of B2B sales experience in SaaS, API solutions, or emerging technologies * A track record of managing complex sales cycles within automotive organisations and securing strategic deals by understanding both technical requirements and automotive use cases&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate automotive organisational structures and procurement processes, building consensus among diverse stakeholders including executives, engineering and manufacturing leadership, and IT departments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex agreements within automotive procurement&amp;nbsp;frameworks and supplier qualification policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets by effectively managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to present confidently to various automotive audiences, from engineers and plant managers to senior executives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of automotive buying cycles, decision-making processes, and key pain points, including long programme timelines and supplier qualification requirements * A strategic, analytical approach to assessing the automotive market combined with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems and their applications. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely and ethically for automotive use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For roles performing work in California: &lt;/strong&gt;We will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with arrest or conviction records or criminal histories, in a manner consistent with the requirements of applicable state and local laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the City of Los Angeles’ Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you from&amp;nbsp;@anthropic.com&amp;nbsp;email addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive at Anthropic, you&#39;ll join the foundational team at the forefront of introducing our cutting-edge AI productivity SaaS solution to large enterprise organizations across CEE. You&#39;ll drive the adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with major corporations, technology companies, and research institutions. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise in the enterprise sector to propel revenue growth while becoming a trusted partner to enterprise stakeholders, helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities across business operations, research, and administration. In collaboration with GTM, Product, and Marketing teams, you&#39;ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to resonate with enterprise decision-makers in the CEE market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic within the enterprise sector across CEE. Navigate complex enterprise organizations to reach key decision-makers, educate them about our services, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to close&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies tailored to enterprise procurement cycles and budgeting processes to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyze enterprise market landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities and campaigns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spearhead market expansion by identifying new use cases within enterprise departments, innovation centers, and operational offices. Collaborate cross-functionally to differentiate our offerings for enterprise applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navigate complex enterprise stakeholder ecosystems including executives, administrators, IT departments, and procurement offices to build consensus across CEE business culture and practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering feedback from enterprise users and conveying market needs from the CEE enterprise landscape. Provide insights that strengthen our value proposition for enterprise customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuously refine the enterprise sales methodology by incorporating learnings into playbooks, templates, and best practices. Identify process improvements that optimize sales productivity and consistency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of B2B sales experience in enterprise technology, preferably pharmaceuticals or life sciences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A track record of managing complex sales cycles within large enterprise organizations and securing strategic deals by understanding both technical requirements and business use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate enterprise bureaucracies and procurement processes, building consensus among diverse stakeholders including executives, administrators, and IT departments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex agreements within enterprise procurement frameworks and policies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets in the enterprise sector by effectively managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to present confidently to various enterprise audiences, from technical teams and business analysts to senior executives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep understanding of enterprise buying cycles, decision-making processes, and key pain points, particularly within the CEE market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strategic, analytical approach to assessing the enterprise market combined with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems and their applications in enterprise environments. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely and ethically for business use&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
