&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive for Digital Native Business based in Seoul, you&#39;ll drive the adoption of safe, frontier AI technology across Korea&#39;s fastest-moving technology companies. This is a greenfield, new business role: you&#39;ll build your territory from the ground up, owning the full sales cycle from first outbound touch to close across Korea&#39;s internet platforms, gaming, e-commerce, SaaS, fintech, and media companies. You&#39;ll work directly with founders, technical leaders, and product teams to help them build with Anthropic&#39;s AI as a core part of their products and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and exceed revenue targets by winning net-new logos across Korea&#39;s digital native companies, including internet platforms, gaming, e-commerce, SaaS, fintech, and media&lt;/li&gt;
