&lt;li&gt;Run fast, consultative sales cycles with founders, CTOs, CPOs, VPs of Engineering, and Heads of AI, positioning Claude as the foundation for AI-powered products and competitive differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Land new accounts quickly and set them up for expansion, working closely with technical buyers and developer teams who evaluate hands-on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate internal teams (Product, Engineering, Applied AI, Partnerships) to win technical evaluations and accelerate time to production for customers building on our models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
