&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive at Anthropic, you&#39;ll join the foundational team at the forefront of introducing our cutting-edge AI productivity API and SaaS solutions to public sector organisations across Spain. You&#39;ll drive the adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic agreements with central government ministries, regional and local administrations, and public agencies. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise in the public sector to propel revenue growth while becoming a trusted partner to public sector stakeholders, helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities in citizen services, administration, and research. In collaboration with GTM, Product, and Marketing teams, you&#39;ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to resonate with public sector decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passion for developing new market segments, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By driving deployment of Anthropic&#39;s emerging products, you will help public institutions obtain new capabilities while also advancing the ethical development of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic within the public sector in Spain. Navigate complex public institutions to reach key decision-makers, educate them about our services, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies tailored to public procurement cycles and budgeting processes, including tenders, framework agreements, and partner or resale routes, to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyse public sector landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead market expansion by identifying new use cases within ministries, agencies, and administrative departments. Collaborate cross-functionally to differentiate our offerings for public sector applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex public sector stakeholder ecosystems including senior officials, digital and technology leaders, IT departments, and procurement offices to build consensus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead conversations with customers on data sovereignty, security, and compliance, working with Security, Legal, and Product colleagues on how we meet those requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering feedback from public sector users and conveying public sector needs. Provide insights that strengthen our value proposition for public institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine the public sector sales methodology by incorporating learnings into playbooks, templates, and best practices. Identify process improvements that optimise sales productivity and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of B2B sales experience in SaaS, API solutions, or emerging technologies, including selling to public sector organisations in Spain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing complex sales cycles within public institutions and securing strategic agreements by understanding both technical requirements and public sector use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical command of Spanish public procurement, including tenders, framework agreements, central purchasing bodies, and partner or resale routes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate public sector organisational structures, building consensus among diverse stakeholders including senior officials, digital and technology leaders, and IT departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets by effectively managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to present confidently to various public sector audiences, from technical teams to senior officials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of public sector buying cycles, decision-making processes, and key pain points, including data sovereignty, security, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, analytical approach to assessing the public sector market combined with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual proficiency in Spanish and English, with excellent written and spoken communication in both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems and their applications. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely and ethically for use by public institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; familiarity with the security and compliance frameworks that apply to technology purchasing in the Spanish public sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acerca del puesto&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Como Enterprise Account Executive en Anthropic, te incorporarás al equipo fundacional que está a la vanguardia de la introducción de nuestra API de productividad con IA de última generación y de nuestras soluciones SaaS en las organizaciones del sector público en España. Impulsarás la adopción de una IA de vanguardia y segura mediante acuerdos estratégicos con ministerios de la Administración General del Estado, administraciones autonómicas y locales y organismos públicos. Pondrás tu experiencia en venta consultiva en el sector público al servicio del crecimiento de los ingresos y te convertirás en un socio de confianza para los interlocutores del sector, ayudándoles a integrar y desplegar la IA y a descubrir todo su potencial en los servicios a la ciudadanía, la administración y la investigación. En colaboración con los equipos de GTM, Producto y Marketing, perfeccionarás de forma continua nuestra propuesta de valor, nuestra metodología de ventas y nuestro posicionamiento para que conecten con quienes toman las decisiones en el sector público.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;El perfil ideal siente pasión por desarrollar nuevos segmentos de mercado, identificar oportunidades de alto potencial y ejecutar las estrategias que permiten aprovecharlas. Al impulsar el despliegue de los productos emergentes de Anthropic, ayudarás a las instituciones públicas a adquirir nuevas capacidades y contribuirás al desarrollo ético de la IA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseguir nuevos clientes y generar ingresos para Anthropic en el sector público en España. Orientarte en instituciones públicas complejas para llegar a las personas clave en la toma de decisiones, darles a conocer nuestros servicios y ayudarles a tener éxito con Anthropic. Serás responsable de todo el ciclo de venta, desde el primer contacto hasta el cierre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diseñar y ejecutar estrategias comerciales innovadoras adaptadas a los ciclos de contratación pública y a los procesos presupuestarios, incluidas las licitaciones, los acuerdos marco y las vías de venta a través de partners o revendedores, para alcanzar y superar los objetivos de ingresos. Analizar el panorama, las tendencias y la dinámica del sector público para convertir los planes estratégicos en acciones y campañas comerciales específicas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liderar la expansión en el mercado identificando nuevos casos de uso en ministerios, organismos y departamentos administrativos. Colaborar de forma transversal para diferenciar nuestra oferta en las aplicaciones del sector público.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desenvolverte en ecosistemas complejos de interlocutores del sector público (altos cargos, responsables de transformación digital y tecnología, departamentos de TI y órganos de contratación) para generar consenso.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liderar las conversaciones con los clientes sobre soberanía del dato, seguridad y cumplimiento normativo, trabajando con los equipos de Seguridad, Legal y Producto en la forma en que respondemos a esos requisitos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuir a la hoja de ruta y a las funcionalidades del producto recogiendo las opiniones de las personas usuarias del sector público y trasladando sus necesidades. Aportar ideas que refuercen nuestra propuesta de valor para las instituciones públicas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perfeccionar de forma continua la metodología de ventas para el sector público incorporando lo aprendido a playbooks, plantillas y buenas prácticas. Identificar mejoras de proceso que optimicen la productividad y la coherencia comerciales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Este puesto puede encajar contigo si tienes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Al menos 7 años de experiencia en ventas B2B (SaaS, soluciones API o tecnologías emergentes), incluida la venta a organizaciones del sector público en España&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Una trayectoria demostrada en la gestión de ciclos de venta complejos en instituciones públicas y en el cierre de acuerdos estratégicos, basada en la comprensión tanto de los requisitos técnicos como de los casos de uso del sector público&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un dominio práctico de la contratación pública española: licitaciones, acuerdos marco, centrales de compras y vías de venta a través de partners o revendedores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacidad demostrada para desenvolverte en las estructuras organizativas del sector público y generar consenso entre interlocutores diversos, entre ellos altos cargos, responsables de transformación digital y tecnología y departamentos de TI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia contrastada superando objetivos de ingresos gracias a una gestión eficaz de un pipeline y un proceso de venta en constante evolución&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excelentes habilidades de comunicación y soltura para presentar ante públicos diversos del sector público, desde equipos técnicos hasta altos cargos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un conocimiento profundo de los ciclos de compra, los procesos de decisión y los principales retos del sector público, incluidos los requisitos de soberanía del dato, seguridad y cumplimiento normativo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un enfoque estratégico y analítico del mercado del sector público, combinado con una ejecución táctica y creativa para aprovechar las oportunidades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nivel bilingüe de español e inglés, con una excelente comunicación oral y escrita en ambos idiomas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pasión por los sistemas avanzados de IA y sus aplicaciones, o experiencia con ellos. Te importa de verdad que los sistemas de IA de vanguardia se desarrollen de forma segura y ética para su uso por parte de las instituciones públicas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Se valorará:&lt;/strong&gt; familiaridad con los marcos de seguridad y cumplimiento normativo aplicables a la contratación de tecnología en el sector público español.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For roles performing work in California: &lt;/strong&gt;We will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with arrest or conviction records or criminal histories, in a manner consistent with the requirements of applicable state and local laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the City of Los Angeles’ Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you from&amp;nbsp;@anthropic.com&amp;nbsp;email addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

