&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive, Retail based in Tokyo, you&#39;ll drive the adoption of safe, frontier AI technology across Japan&#39;s retail, consumer packaged goods (CPG), and general trading companies. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle from prospecting to closing, working with senior leaders to help them optimize operations, strengthen supply chains, personalize customer experiences at scale, and sharpen their competitive position with Anthropic&#39;s AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
