&lt;li&gt;Own and exceed revenue targets by winning new major accounts and expanding existing relationships across Japan&#39;s domestic retailers, CPG manufacturers, and general trading companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute territory plans, identifying high-value opportunities across supermarket and convenience store groups, specialty retailers, food &amp;amp; beverage and consumer goods manufacturers, and sogo shosha and their group companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative sales processes with senior executives — including CIOs, CDOs, CMOs, and heads of supply chain, merchandising, and DX — positioning AI as a driver for demand forecasting, personalization, inventory optimization, trade and supply chain operations, and enhanced customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate internal teams (Product, Engineering, Applied AI, Partnerships) to deliver solutions that integrate with existing retail and enterprise technology stacks while meeting Japan&#39;s data privacy requirements under the APPI framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise sales experience in Japan with significant exposure to retail, CPG, and/or trading company accounts, driving adoption of emerging technologies with a consultative, solutions-oriented approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing complex sales processes and securing strategic deals with large-scale retailers, consumer goods manufacturers, and trading companies by understanding the operational and technology challenges unique to Japan&#39;s consumer and trading sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex stakeholder ecosystems, building consensus across merchandising, supply chain, digital, marketing, and business division teams with multiple budget authorities and approval layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets by effectively managing pipeline across seasonal retail cycles, the rapid decision-making cadence of consumer-facing businesses, and the consensus-driven procurement processes of trading companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
