&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting Workday Procure to Pay functional areas, including Procurement, Supplier Accounts, and Banking and Settlement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of SOX compliance requirements and internal controls for financial systems, including multi-country environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting entity setup or expansion into new countries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical proficiency with SQL, Python, or Workday reporting tools for data analysis and integration support&lt;/p&gt;
