&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have hands-on experience with headless CMS platforms and can navigate content modeling, structured data workflows, and the operational side of keeping a large site running&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have built internal tools or contributed to workflows that improve how teams work day-to-day, and enjoy that kind of problem-solving&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can prototype quickly and iterate confidently, moving from rough idea to working proof-of-concept without getting stuck&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate clearly with both designers and engineers, and care about shipping work that&#39;s both technically sound and visually refined&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a track record of contributing to production web properties at a mid-level scope, and are motivated to grow into owning larger, more complex projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
