&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in management consulting, technology consulting, professional services or customer-facing advisory roles, with a track record of advising senior client executives on complex transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and leading multi-market Customer Success or Technical Success organisations, including managing managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of scaling CS teams across APAC at enterprise software, SaaS or AI/ML companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to balance global alignment with regional localisation across multiple APAC markets and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership: a clear philosophy on hiring, coaching and developing managers and senior ICs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning enterprise customer relationships and driving measurable business outcomes (retention, expansion, adoption) in APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to represent a company credibly with C-suite stakeholders across APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional partnership skills, particularly working across time zones with global leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading Customer Success across APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency in an APAC language (for example Japanese, Korean or an ASEAN language) or a strong record of leading teams that operate in those languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up a CS function in a new APAC market from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in API products, developer platforms or consumption-based business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI/ML technologies and the ability to explain complex technical concepts to business audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with APAC hyperscaler, channel and SI partners on joint customer delivery&lt;/li&gt;
