&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the equity administration and payroll teams, setting strategy, priorities, and operating cadence across both functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the control environment for equity and payroll: design and document to public-company standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee scaling to public-company standards across both functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive systems strategy across the compensation platforms, from equity to payroll, and surrounding integrations, ensuring a coherent architecture as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary escalation point and executive interface for equity and payroll matters with Legal, Tax, HR, and external providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee international expansion of both functions, including new-country payroll setup, cross-border equity compliance, and mobility programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Accounting on stock-based compensation and payroll accounting, ensuring clean handoffs for close, reporting, and audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive automation and continuous improvement of manual processes across both teams through technology solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build headcount and resourcing plans that scale with the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MAY BE A GOOD FIT IF YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 15+ years across equity compensation and/or payroll operations, with significant experience leading senior functional leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have operated equity and payroll functions to a public company standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have deep familiarity with equity management platforms (such as Shareworks or E*TRADE) and Workday payroll, with experience owning cross-system architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built and scaled global operations across multiple jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strong people leader who develops senior functional experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in ambiguous, fast-paced environments and default to building scalable processes over adding headcount&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STRONG CANDIDATES MAY ALSO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold CEP (Certified Equity Professional) or CPP (Certified Payroll Professional) certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with international mobility programs, worker secondments, and cross-border tax considerations&lt;/li&gt;
