ross Anthropic&#39;s product surfaces and operate the internal data retrieval tooling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Run and improve the law enforcement response process and tooling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with Trust and Safety, Security, Privacy, and Engineering on requests that touch user accounts, investigations, or safety escalations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with outside counsel, alongside in-house counsel, on objections, challenges, and narrowing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Produce recurring reporting on request volume, deadlines, and queue health, and support Anthropic&#39;s periodic transparency reporting on government requests&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monitor legal developments in government access to user data and advise the team on their operational impact&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Support litigation and regulatory matters and stretch beyond core responsibilities as needed to support the legal team&#39;s objectives&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in a legal operations, business/operations manager, or paralegal role in an in-house legal department, or similar experience&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Direct, front-line experience handling law enforcement or government requests for user data, including subpoenas, court orders, warrants, preservation letters, and emergency disclosure requests&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of the legal framework for law enforcement access to user data, including the Stored Communications Act and the mechanics of foreign and cross-border requests such as MLATs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with colleagues at all levels of the organization&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to exercise good judgment and maintain the highest standards of discretion and confidentiality when handling sensitive legal matters, including under time pressure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong project management skills, including the ability to prioritize tasks, meet deadlines, and manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience owning an intake, queue, or docketing process end to end,&amp;nbsp; including deciding what gets escalated and maintaining rigorous tracking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfort operating and improving the tooling a legal process runs on (trackers, spreadsheets, forms, aliases, and simple automations), with a willingness to make changes directly rather than route every change to someone else&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A proactive, solutions-oriented approach to identifying, recommending, and implementing process improvements within the legal department&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;5+ years of experience in legal operations, business/operations management, or a paralegal role in an in-house legal department&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;2+ years of experience at a high-growth technology company, with exposure to the legal challenges and opportunities presented by emerging technologies&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience building or scaling a law enforcement response process&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience managing legal intake process within a growing company&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to think critically and creatively, adapting to new challenges and finding practical solutions to complex legal issues&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with legal project management software such as Asana, Trello, or Jira, and a willingness to learn and adopt new tools to streamline legal processes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
