&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build strong partnerships across the organization to drive strategic initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and execute on new market opportunities and use cases for Anthropic&#39;s AI solutions across enterprise segments&lt;/p&gt;
