&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide cybersecurity subject matter expertise to cyber customers and the CSMs supporting them: bring domain knowledge of security operations, detection and response, identity, cloud and data protection to customer engagements, and coach the team on how cyber vendors build, buy and embed AI so they can engage credibly with CISOs, CTOs and principal engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive team accountability to core CS metrics: expansion (consumption growth, cross-sell/upsell opportunity identification), customer health scores, retention (NRR), and customer satisfaction (CSAT)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join strategic customer engagements and escalations, demonstrating executive presence with C-level stakeholders at leading cybersecurity companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and refine scalable CS processes including success planning frameworks, QBR templates, and expansion playbooks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Sales to identify expansion opportunities, facilitate smooth handoffs, and ensure aligned account strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
