&lt;p&gt;Serve as escalation point for at-risk accounts and complex customer situations within your team&#39;s portfolio&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop customer advocacy programs including case studies, testimonials, and reference architecture development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Champion responsible AI deployment practices with customers and represent Anthropic&#39;s values in all customer interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
