&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear, concise written communication: you can brief an executive in three sentences and write a process doc the next person can run from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and a bias toward action in a fast-moving environment with many priorities at once&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excitement about building the operational backbone that lets Anthropic&#39;s products launch and scale safely&lt;/p&gt;
