&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Development Manager for Enterprise at Anthropic, you will lead the team that opens our most strategic customer relationships. You&#39;ll build and manage a team of 6-10 Business Development Representatives (BDRs) who generate high-value pipeline inside complex enterprise organizations through account-based prospecting, multi-threaded outreach, and rigorous qualification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprise buying is long and involves many stakeholders. The work here is less about volume and more about depth: knowing an account well enough to reach the right people with the right message, and staying with it long enough to turn early conversations into real opportunities. You&#39;ll bring a strong understanding of enterprise sales cycles and organizational dynamics, and you&#39;ll coach your team to develop strategic accounts over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with Enterprise Account Executives and with leaders across Sales, Revenue Operations, Strategy, and Marketing. You&#39;ll also develop the next generation of Anthropic&#39;s enterprise sellers, helping BDRs grow into Account Executive roles while they help the world&#39;s largest organizations adopt safe, frontier AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and scale a team of BDRs focused on the Enterprise segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic pipeline generation through account-based prospecting and targeted outbound campaigns to Global 2000 accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach your team on partnering with Enterprise Account Executives to develop account plans, coordinate multi-threaded outreach, and ensure high-quality opportunity handoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and track KPIs focused on opportunity quality, deal size, and strategic account penetration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and model for your team on enterprise prospecting, stakeholder mapping, and complex qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of enterprise buying processes, and coach the team on navigating procurement, legal, and security requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own pipeline reviews with sales leadership covering enterprise pipeline health, account penetration, and competitive positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with cross-functional leaders and partners across Sales, Revenue Operations, Strategy, and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor BDRs on strategic prospecting, executive engagement, and career development toward Account Executive roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing BDR, SDR, or new business Account Executive teams in an enterprise-focused sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building teams that prospect successfully into complex enterprise organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with account-based selling strategies, including account planning, stakeholder mapping, and multi-threaded outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with a CRM and sales engagement tooling (e.g., Salesforce, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, or similar), and the analytical skills to design prospecting systems and measure pipeline quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to coach representatives on navigating complex organizational structures and multi-stakeholder deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, including the ability to engage executive-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of Anthropic’s products, ecosystem, and hands on building experience with LLMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement about Anthropic&#39;s mission to develop AI that is safe and beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal closing experience as an Account Executive, Account Manager, ideally in a management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing teams that prospect into Fortune 500 or Global 2000 accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing BDRs who move successfully into enterprise Account Executive roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building enterprise prospecting playbooks where none existed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Claude, Claude Code, or other AI prospecting tools, and with sales tools such as Apollo and HubSpot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in API-first, consumption-based, or platform business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in AI or machine learning, cloud infrastructure, or developer platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise procurement, security review, and legal processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
