&lt;li&gt;Experience building marketing measurement for both enterprise sales-led and product-led growth motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with marketing attribution models and their practical tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting metrics and insights directly to executives and shaping how leadership reviews performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in data science, analytics engineering, or marketing operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRM and marketing automation data, such as Salesforce and related tooling&lt;/li&gt;
