&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on proficiency with AI tools.&lt;/strong&gt; You use Claude and/or other AI tools in your day to day and understand their impact firsthand&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort being the single owner of a program while depending on teams you do not manage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ownership of, or close partnership with, a certification or badging program, including assessment design and recertification&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Skilljar or another learning management system, and with partner portals or resource hubs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Facilitation of change management or AI fluency programs for non-technical teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time at a capacity-building organization, an intermediary, or an edtech or technology company serving the sector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading work through contractors or vendors while keeping several programs coherent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
