&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with AI-specific regulation, such as the EU AI Act&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading incident response programs, including escalation paths and external reporting obligations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
