&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of executing end-to-end on large and complex products, or a series of products, in ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating user-centered design thinking and polished UI craftsmanship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with modern design and prototyping tools, such as Figma&lt;/li&gt;
