&lt;div&gt;The vision for Claude Marketplace is to create an ecosystem flywheel, connecting builders and buyers. We&#39;re hiring a Product Manager to own the Marketplace as a product, for the partners who sell on it and the customers who buy through it. You&#39;ll work closely with the Marketplace team, which owns the partner and customer relationships as well as the commercial motion, and build on systems owned by other product and engineering teams. You&#39;ll have a lot of room to define and build the experience fitting for an AI native world.&lt;/div&gt;
