&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have owned a product end to end, including the operational workflows behind it, and were the person accountable for its outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built with or shipped on top of large language models, and have used them to make a product experience better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have led cross-functional work where most of the teams you depended on didn&#39;t report to you, and earned their trust quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can present to executives at partner companies and represent Anthropic well in front of them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clearly enough that an engineer, an executive and an external partner can each see the tradeoff you&#39;re making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care about Anthropic&#39;s mission, and specifically about building an ecosystem where the companies that build on Claude grow along with it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
