&lt;p&gt;Can show examples of moving fluidly between high-volume pipelines and strategic searches without sacrificing quality or candidate experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have managed heavy req loads across multiple hiring managers, and use data to prioritize, spot bottlenecks, and surface issues before they become problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build repeatable processes and are actively experimenting with AI and automation tools to increase your throughput&lt;/p&gt;
