&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring an ownership mentality across a diverse portfolio, with a continuous improvement mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are deeply curious about Anthropic&#39;s mission and passionate about AI&#39;s potential to positively impact the world&lt;/p&gt;
