&lt;li&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting for GTM roles, from intake through offer and close, with a strong emphasis on candidate experience and stakeholder partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic relationships with hiring managers and leaders, serving as their primary partner on hiring and translating their goals into calibrated role requirements, must-have skills, and assessment criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in the markets our GTM teams serve, understanding where the talent sits, what motivates it, and what distinguishes a strong candidate from a plausible one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute sourcing strategies for competitive, specialized commercial talent, including targeted outreach campaigns, market mapping, and cultivating talent pools that don&#39;t yet exist as pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise GTM leaders on talent market conditions, compensation dynamics, pipeline health, and realistic timelines, including when a search needs to be reframed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and refine interview loops, intake practices, and assessment approaches for roles that are new or evolving, partnering with hiring managers to define what &quot;good&quot; looks like before the first candidate enters the process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an inclusive and consistent process, using structured interviews and calibrated criteria that reduce the influence of bias on hiring decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Recruiting Operations to use pipeline data and metrics to diagnose bottlenecks and inform resourcing decisions, process improvements, and candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a thought partner to hiring managers on organizational design questions, including what a team actually needs, how roles should be scoped, and where a hire will and won&#39;t solve the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Anthropic&#39;s mission, culture, and approach to AI safety authentically to commercial candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
