&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Give the delivery team and leadership one trustworthy view of where every project stands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consolidated milestone tracking (early floor access, floor access, RFS) current across all projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Schedule and status data reconciled at the source.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Portfolio capacity projections and variance to plan maintained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delivery-review and executive reporting built; data-quality checks automated where possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Project controls / scheduling on large capital programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Portfolio-level, not single-job, reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scheduling, spreadsheet, and BI tooling fluency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identifying, qualifying, and packaging data driven insights that define project and portfolio health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own consolidated milestone tracking across all active and upcoming delivery projects — early floor access, floor access, ready for service — and keep it current&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validate schedule and status data from developers, GCs, and third-party partners; challenge what doesn&#39;t reconcile and fix it at the source&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain portfolio capacity projections and the variance to plan behind them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain reporting for delivery reviews and executive updates&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define the data standards and integrated-schedule and tooling conventions projects report against, with the Program Management Lead&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automate reporting and data-quality checks where possible, including with AI-assisted tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have [7+] years in project controls, scheduling, or program reporting on large capital construction programs — data center, energy, or industrial&lt;/p&gt;
