&lt;p&gt;Have run consolidated reporting across a multi-project portfolio, not a single job&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are fluent in scheduling, spreadsheet, and BI tooling [e.g. Primavera P6, Excel, Power BI — confirm]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate clearly, in writing and in charts, to technical and executive audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable building the process while running it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hyperscaler, colo, or developer-side program-controls experience&lt;/p&gt;
