&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong software engineering fundamentals and a track record of building performant, reliable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on ML infrastructure, distributed systems, or research tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care about enabling other people&#39;s work and find leverage through platforms rather than individual experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable operating across the stack, from low-level performance work to RL algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a bias toward shipping and iterating quickly, with a mix of high agency and low ego&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
