&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Have a Ph.D. in a biological science (molecular biology, biochemistry, bioengineering, computational biology) or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Have a track record of bridging biological domain knowledge with computational approaches to solve real scientific problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Have basic proficiency in Python and are familiar with ML development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
