&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of biologics process development experience beyond the PhD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in both upstream (cell line development, bioreactors) and downstream (chromatography, filtration) development, with working knowledge of analytical and formulation development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up a protein production or process development laboratory, including laboratory automation and high-throughput, plate-based expression and purification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience directing technology transfer and GMP manufacturing at contract development and manufacturing organizations, with contributions to the CMC sections of an IND&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistics or coding skills, for example design of experiments or Python for data analysis and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI or ML tools in the life sciences&lt;/li&gt;
