&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with generative AI products, including an understanding of how AI systems can be misused to generate or facilitate abusive content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing or evaluating trauma-informed support structures and wellness protocols for content reviewers working with harmful material&lt;/p&gt;
