&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll lead a team of Account Executives driving the adoption of safe, frontier AI with top enterprises across Korea. This role is critical to Anthropic&#39;s APAC expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll leverage your leadership expertise to propel revenue growth while developing a high-performing team. Working closely with Applied AI Engineering, Product, GTM, and Marketing teams, you&#39;ll help enterprise customers deploy AI solutions and refine our market positioning for Korea.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a deep understanding of Korean business culture, a passion for developing people, and the ability to navigate Korea&#39;s relationship-driven, conglomerate-centric enterprise sales environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Build and lead a high-performing team of Account Executives, providing coaching, mentorship, and guidance to drive team success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Develop and implement sales strategies tailored to enterprise procurement cycles and budgeting processes to meet and exceed team revenue quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Create and maintain accurate forecasts, pipeline management, and reporting while ensuring data integrity in CRM systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Partner with Enablement to develop training programs and resources that accelerate AE ramp time and effectiveness, with focus on Korean enterprise buying cycles and decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Work closely with Applied AI Engineering teams to demonstrate technical capabilities pre-sales and optimize solutions post-sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Enable your team to have credible technical conversations about AI applications while maintaining appropriate guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Build strong partnerships across the organization to drive strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Identify and execute on new market opportunities and use cases for Anthropic&#39;s AI solutions across enterprise segments, including Korea&#39;s large conglomerates and fast-growing digital-native companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Help your team navigate complex enterprise stakeholder ecosystems including executives, IT departments, and procurement offices to build alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;15+ years of enterprise sales experience, preferably driving adoption of SaaS or emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;5+ years of sales leadership experience within the Enterprise segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of building and leading high-performing sales teams selling into large enterprises, with demonstrated success in coaching and developing AEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Experience establishing and scaling sales processes, tools, and methodologies in fast-growing organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Strong technical acumen with ability to enable credible AI conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Track record of successful partnership with technical teams throughout the customer journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of enterprise buying cycles, procurement frameworks, and common pain points across industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex, multithreaded sales cycles across diverse stakeholder groups and drive cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Experience managing complex enterprise sales cycles and helping AEs secure strategic deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills and ability to build relationships across all levels, from individual contributors to C-suite executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Strategic approach to market analysis combined with tactical excellence in execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Passion for AI technology and commitment to its safe, responsible development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Business-level Korean required; English proficiency strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
