&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong presentation and communication skills with ability to build relationships across all customer levels, from ICs to founders and C-level executives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
