&lt;p&gt;Have worked in AI/ML companies and understand unique security considerations for model development and deployment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have worked with cloud companies and understand cloud security controls and physical security requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring experience from high-growth technology companies managing rapid compliance expansion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
