&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cutting sandbox cold start from seconds to milliseconds with snapshot-based restore and pre-warmed pools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designing a network egress policy layer so agents can reach approved services without exposing secrets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Running many thousands of parallel reinforcement learning environments with strong isolation between them&lt;/p&gt;
