&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building tracing tools that attribute latency and resource use inside a running sandbox&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reducing per-sandbox memory overhead to raise density on each host&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hardening the runtime against escape attempts found in internal red-team exercises&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
