&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have direct experience marketing software products to security audiences, including familiarity with how CISOs, SOC leaders, and security engineering teams evaluate and buy technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a 0-to-1 environment — can build processes where none exist and navigate ambiguity across a complex stakeholder landscape&lt;/li&gt;
