&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every change to Anthropic&#39;s software has to reach production somehow: new code, runtime configuration, feature flags, infrastructure changes. Our team builds the systems those changes travel through. Our mission is to give every team at Anthropic a fast, safe, and predictable path from change to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We sit within Anthropic&#39;s Infrastructure organization and own pipelines, staged rollouts, health-gated promotion, and rollback, along with runtime configuration, feature flags, and the systems that deliver code and artifacts to machines across a very large fleet. You&#39;ll own a meaningful part of this end to end, from design through operating it in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want your work to shape how fast and how safely Anthropic ships, this could be a great fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for major parts of the deployment platform and own them end to end: design, implementation, and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rollout safety into the platform, including progressive delivery, health-gated promotion, automatic pause and rollback, and deploy controls that teams manage themselves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design APIs and abstractions that work equally well for engineers and for AI agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend the platform to new workload types and runtimes, from Kubernetes to serverless and edge platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate runtime configuration and feature flag systems with validation, gradual rollout, and fast rollback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build infrastructure-as-code workflows that many teams rely on for safe, routine changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale artifact distribution so code and configuration reach machines quickly and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security so that the path to production is secure by default, with verifiable builds, least-privilege access, and auditable changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with teams across Anthropic to understand their deployment needs and bring their workloads onto the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in on-call and incident response, and turn what you learn into guardrails that prevent the same problem from recurring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
