&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one backend or systems programming language, such as Rust, Go, C++, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading the design, building, and operation of distributed systems or infrastructure in production, including technical direction across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure and containerized workloads, such as Kubernetes on AWS or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
