&lt;li&gt;Experience leading large, complex technical projects across teams, from an ambiguous problem to a solution developers adopt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, with experience supporting internal partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in Anthropic&#39;s mission of building safe, beneficial AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
