&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more systems languages (e.g., C, C++, Rust, Go)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience as a software engineer, and a Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering or comparable professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building data infrastructure for ML: training datasets, offline batch inference or evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
