&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-lfile-container=&quot;3b0ab87e-d405-4b95-afd6-4d87d7e47edc&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We believe powerful AI can compress a century of scientific progress into a decade. Bringing Claude to scientists and engineers is a big part of building toward that future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Claude has already helped &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-discovers-novel-enzyme-system&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;uncover a novel enzyme system&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/research/formalizing-fermats-last-theorem&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;formalize Fermat’s Last Theorem&lt;/a&gt;, design &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/research/designing-efficient-quantum-circuits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;more efficient quantum circuits&lt;/a&gt;, and compute &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/research/yes-claude-can-do-nine-loops&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;new results in theoretical physics&lt;/a&gt; — and this is just the beginning. You’ll figure out what scientists and engineers need from Claude and build it from 0→1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be a technical leader with a high degree of autonomy, helping clear the path to harnessing scientific AGI. You’ll work with internal experts and industry partners. Initiatives like our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-program&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI for Science Program&lt;/a&gt; will connect you with researchers we support in high-impact work across scientific fields.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build products that unlock scientific discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product management, design, and go-to-market to make complex workflows, like modeling and simulation, simple to run with Claude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with research to make models better at science and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend time with users in academia and industry to decide what to build next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical design and delivery end to end, shipping product quickly rather than just executing a spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering experience, including owning the technical design and delivery of products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products from 0 to 1 in fast-moving environments, and setting technical direction with limited precedent to lean on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI products, and knowledge of what it takes to turn model capabilities into applications people actually use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think holistically about user experience and craft tools that are a pleasure for scientists and engineers to use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working directly with technical domain experts and customers, and turning what you learn into product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoyment of solving hard problems together with researchers, scientists, and other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
