&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing intelligent routing algorithms that optimize request distribution across many accelerators in different environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autoscaling our compute fleet to dynamically match supply with demand across production, research, and experimental workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building production-grade deployment pipelines for releasing new models to millions of users reliably&lt;/li&gt;
