&lt;li&gt;Have experience building partnerships with external organizations including chambers of commerce, economic development groups, labor organizations, and universities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have exposure to technology policy or emerging technology regulation; understand the unique challenges of navigating policy for rapidly evolving technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate understanding of how to build coalitions and identify aligned constituencies to advance shared objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can manage multiple priorities and stakeholder relationships across different states and adapt to different political environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can work well under time pressure and manage competing demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can translate complex technical topics into clear, accessible language for policymakers and residents alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience working with communications teams to develop effective messaging for policy campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
