&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Technical Program Manager to lead high priority safety and security programs which advance defense in depth for agents, which we have &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/news/improving-alignment-security-efforts&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;written about publicly&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the lead TPM coordinating work across teams to strengthen how we develop and deploy agents safely and securely, and to bring what we build internally to customers and partners so everyone has the tools to safely and securely use Claude. You will be responsible for leading meetings with executives and technical leads, maintaining complex project plans, identifying and addressing risks, developing metrics, and communicating to the company and our customers about this work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
