&lt;li&gt;Have shipped software or infrastructure into regulated or restricted environments (government clouds, air-gapped deployments, FedRAMP or similar authorization frameworks) and can engage meaningfully with the infrastructure, ML, and security engineers doing the work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience coordinating across multiple engineering teams and organizations simultaneously, including research, security, and compliance partners&lt;/li&gt;
