&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;text-accent-secondary-100 underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/research/estimating-productivity-gains&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Estimating AI productivity gains from Claude conversations&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
